{"type": "CHUNK", "content": "Bob: este e um relatorio de pesquisa de mercado, nao uma ordem de compra. Lucro nao e garantido.\n\n1) Classificacao: pesquisa de oportunidade de curto prazo.\n2) Horizonte: aproximadamente 2 semanas (curto prazo).\n3) Universo do scan: US_CANADA_LIQUID\n4) Gate de qualidade de dados: ticker, exchange, preco atual, volume/liquidez, catalisador de curto prazo, risco e condicao de invalidacao sao obrigatorios. Sem todos esses campos, o candidato e rejeitado.\n\n5) Candidatos:\n- NVDA (NVIDIA Corporation)\n  Mercado: United States\n  Preco atual: 214.75 USD\n  Volume/liquidez: 150.15M shares/day ($32.24B/day)\n  Razao/catalisador (2 sem.): bullish trend: price ($214.75) above 50d MA ($201.27) and 200d MA ($188.07), uptrend intact\n  Risco: trend reversal; max loss 0.5% of trading capital\n  Invalidacao: close below 50-day MA ($201.27)\n  Confianca: pesquisa-apenas\n- NOK (Nokia Corporation Sponsored)\n  Mercado: United States\n  Preco atual: 16.73 EUR\n  Volume/liquidez: 140.67M shares/day ($2.35B/day)\n  Razao/catalisador (2 sem.): bullish trend: price ($16.73) above 50d MA ($11.70) and 200d MA ($7.58), uptrend intact\n  Risco: trend reversal; max loss 0.5% of trading capital\n  Invalidacao: close below 50-day MA ($11.70)\n  Confianca: pesquisa-apenas\n- INTC (Intel Corporation)\n  Mercado: United States\n  Preco atual: 112.71 USD\n  Volume/liquidez: 116.56M shares/day ($13.14B/day)\n  Razao/catalisador (2 sem.): bullish trend: price ($112.71) above 50d MA ($84.99) and 200d MA ($50.02), uptrend intact\n  Risco: trend reversal; max loss 0.5% of trading capital\n  Invalidacao: close below 50-day MA ($84.99)\n  Confianca: pesquisa-apenas\n- NU (Nu Holdings Ltd.)\n  Mercado: United States\n  Preco atual: 11.64 USD\n  Volume/liquidez: 111.19M shares/day ($1.29B/day)\n  Razao/catalisador (2 sem.): NU: liquid equity on major US exchange, market cap $56590667776.0 — suitable for short-term tactical allocation\n  Risco: broad market / sector risk;